    738  f0f3							; Store ORDER is cycle-critical (thin-yellow-line fix, 2026-10-01): the
    739  f0f3							; stores land mid-visible (advance block then these pairs), so on the
    740  f0f3							; row1→row2 band-transition line the left half must keep the OLD band's
    741  f0f3							; PF+color while the right half may show the NEW band. Write cycles
    742  f0f3							; (cN = CPU cycles on the setup line, x = pixel at 4x, HBLANK ends c22.7):
