    750  f0f3							; x187, PF2 cell17 ends x287); cells18-19 (x288-319) are never ON in any
    751  f0f3							; model row (PF2 bits6/7 always 0) so the flip there is invisible (BG =
    752  f0f3							; COLUBK). PF2 LAST: store lands past every right-half PF2 pixel (x449)
