    809  f117							; = 72 <=76). Row2 path byte-identical in cost (cpx/beqT/lda/sta/WSYNC
    810  f117							; = 11+3 = 76, zero margin — the `beq` target is 9 bytes ahead, same
    811  f117							; page, T=3c; do not let this block grow toward a page edge).
