    893  f13f							; BeamMask = {0,0,2,0,0...} → ENAM0 on RoomY+2 only (single yellow
    894  f13f							; strip — user directive 2026-10-08: the red row-3 strip is gone;
    895  f13f							; kill window in LaserHitTestBody keeps rows RoomY+2..3 = superset).
    896  f13f							; In-window path is the only safe place (Y<11 guaranteed); outside the
    897  f13f							; window ENAM0 keeps its last in-window write ($00 at A0=10) — no HUD
