    940  f166							; --- Advance to next tile row (X clobbered by object section: reload) ---
    941  f166							; Phase C vcrunch shutter: while the band's slice run is live
    942  f166							; (RowIdx == VcrBand, VcrNext in 1..4) the row does NOT advance — the
    943  f166							; tail hands the setup line to RowSlice, which renders the next
    944  f166							; sub-slice of the shutter band and jumps to SliceReentry. Slice path
    945  f166							; ≈59c + jmp 3c = 62c from the previous WSYNC (<=73 => single line);
    946  f166							; non-shutter pass-end +10c (three zp compares — VcrNext=0 is the
    947  f166							; idle marker so a title-stomp VcrBand=0 coincidences cannot slice)
    948  f166							; — measured segments stay under the 152c double-line ceiling.
    949  f166							; RowSlice lives in the $FBD0 fill hole (below). TAIL JMP, not jsr:
    950  f166							; the slice loop would otherwise push 4 returns per frame that the
    951  f166							; jmp re-entry never pops (stack decay — F6-hotspot family), and the
    952  f166							; old jsr + rts + lda/sta GRP0 + jmp tail was +14c on the first body
