   1053  f1ba							; --- Call bank1 for 13+2 HUD rendering via fold-pad at $FC68 ---
   1054  f1ba							; The fold-pad at $FC68 has identical bytes in bank0 and bank1:
   1055  f1ba							;   $FC68: lda #1 / sta $1FF7 / jmp $F540
   1056  f1ba							; After sta $1FF7, CPU reads next instruction from bank1 at $FC6D.
