   1143  f22a							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1144  f22a							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1145  f22a							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1146  f22a							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1147  f22a							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1148  f22a							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
