   1498  f3e9							; UpdateEnemies — per-type live motion from RAM shadow (overscan).
   1499  f3e9							; E0: loop runs EVERY frame; each type carries its own speed gate (snake
   1500  f3e9							; ÷4 here; bat ungated, spider ÷8, tentacle ÷2/÷8, moth ÷2 in E1-E4).
   1501  f3e9							; Snake patrol: bounds relative to ROM spawn X ± SNAKE_PATROL (6 px, was
   1502  f3e9							; ± ENEMY_WIDTH = overshoot), side chosen by ROM dir (initial facing). Ignores editor range_* per user
   1503  f3e9							; 2026-09-23. First move = facing (live dir from LoadEnemyRam). No wall collision.
   1504  f3e9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
