   1977  f644							; SelectActiveObject — choose the single GRP1 object to draw this frame.
   1978  f644							; The TIA has one GRP1 sprite, so objects flicker by rotating slots each frame.
   1979  f644							; Sets ObjBase, ActiveObjectX, ActiveObjectY, ObjTop, COLUP1.
   1980  f644							; Slot count (enemies + miner?) lives in Temp for this VBLANK only.
   1981  f644							; Bomb fuse (state=1): low-priority — bomb only when (BombTimer&3)==0
   1982  f644							; (~15 Hz); other frames normal miner/enemy rotation (FlickerFrame alone).
   1983  f644							; One GRP1: cannot draw bomb + entity same frame.
   1984  f644							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
