   2543  f926							; PlayerHitsMap — check player bounding box against the room's PF map
   2544  f926							; ==============================================================================
   2545  f926							; Boxes are in tile coordinates (col 0-19, row 0-2); the walk tests the
   2546  f926							; PF0/1/2Buf cell bits directly (cell_collision_plan 2.1) — no rect cache,
   2547  f926							; no rect-count limit. The playfield is reflected, so right-half display
   2548  f926							; cols mirror via 39-col IN THE PROLOGUE (walk sees left-half only).
   2549  f926							; Returns C=0 if clear, C=1 if blocked.
   2550  f926				   PlayerHitsMap
