   2729  f9c4							; PositionBallM1 — D6 asymmetric objects, BOTH positioned in one VBL call.
   2730  f9c4							; WHY here: pre-pad headroom is 1B — inline ball+m1 (22B) cannot live in the
   2731  f9c4							; VBL block, so the ball block became this jsr and the body sits in the
   2732  f9c4							; $F9C4..$FBF7 fill (ReturnPad pin at $FBF8 unaffected; F6-safe:
   2733  f9c4							; $F9C4 & $1FFF = $19C4 ∉ $1FF6-$1FF9; bank0-only, not a fold twin).
