   3368  fda9							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3369  fda9							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3370  fda9							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
