   3715  ff33							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3716  ff33							; LaserInput — contact missile (redesign 2026-10-08, replaces the S3 sweep):
   3717  ff33							; the beam is ONE 8px bar that LEAVES the EYE and travels +/-4px/frame toward
   3718  ff33							; the facing until contact, then resets to the eye (single missile, KISS —
   3719  ff33							; user spec: no piercing, no HERO comparison needed).
   3720  ff33							;   press edge (b7 held, b6 prev): LaserX = eye  (right RoomX-1 = nose,
   3721  ff33							;						  left	RoomX-4)
   3722  ff33							;   held frame: LaserX +/-4; LaserX >= 160 (right edge OR left underflow
   3723  ff33							;     wrap) -> reset to eye (unsigned check catches both)
   3724  ff33							;   contact (bank2 LaserHitTestBody): A = 0 continue / $50 kill (+score,
   3725  ff33							;     dead bit set in body) / 1 lamp (SetRoomDark) / 2 wall tip -> all three
   3726  ff33							;     contact kinds reset LaserX = eye BEFORE positioning (missile consumed;
   3727  ff33							;     tip-in-wall never draws: contact frame restarts at the eye; PF has
   3728  ff33							;     priority over M0 anyway).
   3729  ff33							;   release: b7/b1 cleared in the prologue, HMM0 = 0; LaserX kept (next
   3730  ff33							;     press edge re-anchors).
   3731  ff33							; PIXEL MODEL (unchanged): SetObjectXPos arg A -> drawn M0 = [A-7, A].
   3732  ff33							; LaserState: b7 held, b6 prev (press edge), b5-2 dark, b1 = .Line gate,
   3733  ff33							; b0 = rearm (contact consumed last frame — re-test the eye next frame)
   3734  ff33							; (BeamMask = $02 shares b1 — ENAM0 = BeamMask & LaserState; the old
   3735  ff33							; LaserBeamOn $02 byte now holds LaserX, there was no free ZP byte).
   3736  ff33							; S5.4: kill/lamp/wall ACTIONS run here (pad body returns only A).
   3737  ff33							; Overscan: VBLANK on, end waits on TIM64T — SetObjectXPos's WSYNC costs 1
   3738  ff33							; of 30 lines. Temp (joystick) intact. Lives after $FF20 (pre-$FF00 full).
   3739  ff33							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3740  ff33				   LaserInput
